ast  ten pounds and eventually maintaining  your weight we should already start  adopting healthier habits effortlessly  small habits like standing more often or  get out and walk every day will help you  to burn an additional of 200 to 300  calories without even trying hard so  when you can walk to places choose to  walk up the stairs instead or do your  regular morning walks while intense  workouts tend to make us hungry walking  does not have the same effect so walking  is a really easy way to burn extra fat  without increasing our appetite the last  tip is to stop being obsessed and focus  on performance goal instead being  obsessed with this magic number will  lead to stress stress will cause your  body to hold on to precious fat so when  you're getting stressed out because the  skill isn't moving well guess what the  additional stress is actually hindering  the skill from moving so instead of  focusing on the magic number shift your  focus to fuel performance goal for  instance if you can't do any two  push-ups yet make that your goal to be  able to do three to five push-ups by the  end of the month if you have just joined  a dance class or a yoga class make it  your goal to master and perfect all the  moves and believe me when you achieve  your performance goal you will see the  skill move you will feel and look better  and more importantly you had fun doing  it instead of just getting stressed out  so start trusting that all the positive  changes you've made in your life are  going to work focus on enjoying the  process instead as you are getting  closer to your goal  remember fitness is for life it's not  just a magic number to achieve once you  have achieved it and then what mix  things up make your trainings fun and  your your meals having a much more  relaxed Fitness approach has helped me  to maintain my win and I am sure  we'll help you two for new fitness food  and motivational videos please like  share and subscribe to my youtube  channel and website